1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,050
Cat: Leo... I need to tell you something. I took the shortcut.

2
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:11,550
Lion: So... you did not run the whole race?

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:16,290
Cat: No. I wanted to win. I am sorry.

4
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:22,090
Lion: Winning is fun. But I thought we were racing together.

5
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:27,805
Cat: Can we try again? No shortcuts this time.

6
00:00:28,455 --> 00:00:33,295
Lion: Together. And this time, the loser buys the picnic!